{"id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-hyperimmune-set.md","title":"集合的超免疫性","display":"df-hyperimmune-set — 集合的超免疫性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","aliases":["43-df-hyperimmune-set"],"display":"df-hyperimmune-set — 集合的超免疫性","depends_on":["[[43-df-strong-array]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14, hyperimmune sets before Lemma 5.14.4","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"79","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-hyperimmune-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-hyperimmune-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyperimmune-set — 集合的超免疫性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d5075bfcb91a90c\" href=\"?note=4d5075bfcb91a90c\" title=\"43-df-strong-array\">43-df-strong-array</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14, hyperimmune sets before Lemma 5.14.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongArray}\">\\(\\operatorname{StrongArray}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4d5075bfcb91a90c\" href=\"?note=4d5075bfcb91a90c\" title=\"43-df-strong-array\">43-df-strong-array</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(A)\\iff |A|=\\infty\\land\\forall F\\;\\left(\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\Rightarrow\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i\\cap A=\\varnothing)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(A)\\iff |A|=\\infty\\land\\forall F\\;\\left(\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\Rightarrow\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i\\cap A=\\varnothing)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里是特定集合的稀疏性；43-df-hyperimmune-free中的Hyperimmune(A)则是A的Turing度计算不可支配函数的性质。二者不能仅凭同名直接替换。源PDF图像已核对：原文F_i包含于A的补集，文本抽取丢失了补集横线。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.14, hyperimmune sets before Lemma 5.14.4，印刷页59，PDF页79。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-strong-array","status":"resolved","id":"4d5075bfcb91a90c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-strong-array]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-strong-array","status":"resolved","id":"4d5075bfcb91a90c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$F$ 量化于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\operatorname{StrongArray}$ 见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongArray}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(A)\\iff |A|=\\infty\\land\\forall F\\;\\left(\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\Rightarrow\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i\\cap A=\\varnothing)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1429,"backlinks":[{"id":"3c204d52497e7421","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{CE}$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 采用 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]] — 集合的超免疫性"},{"id":"84509a9312e5b529","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]] 的度性质；$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]] 的集合性质，$\\equiv_T$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"a09ec8a13786db93","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["4d5075bfcb91a90c"]}